WEBVTT

00:02:27.876 --> 00:02:32.836
but in order to take
the kind of radical, decisive action

00:02:32.876 --> 00:02:35.396
that our planet is calling for,

00:02:35.396 --> 00:02:37.916
we need to be fully present,

00:02:37.956 --> 00:02:40.276
grounded and alert,

00:02:40.316 --> 00:02:42.356
fearless and free.

00:02:43.236 --> 00:02:46.036
It is our way of being

00:02:46.036 --> 00:02:49.076
that has got us into our current crises,

00:02:49.116 --> 00:02:53.436
and it is our way of being
that can get us out.

00:02:54.716 --> 00:02:57.196
Mindful walking can help.

00:02:58.716 --> 00:03:05.116
We really feel the contact
between our feet and the ground.